<title>USA: Austin ISD, Texas won by Rauscher Pierce.</title>
<headline>Austin ISD, Texas won by Rauscher Pierce.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Rauscher Pierce Refsnes said it won $7.870 million of Austin ISD, Texas, public property finance limited tax contractual obligations, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.7666 percent.</p>
</text>
